    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d196">

                <pb facs="0577" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1945v02/pg565"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.00/10–1945</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Halifax</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-19">October 19,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Secretary of State</hi>: Mr. Bevin has asked
                    me to send you the enclosed copy of a message addressed to him by Field Marshal
                        Smuts<anchor n="15" xml:id="d196-f1"/> concerning Russia’s policy as
                    revealed at the Council of Foreign Ministers. In agreement with Field Marshal
                    Smuts, Mr. Bevin wishes you to have it for your personal and very confidential
                    information.</p>
                <p>Mr. Bevin asks me to explain that he feels you may like to see what, in his view,
                    is a wise and understanding message which reflects the great experience and
                    mature judgment of its author. He has told the Field Marshal that he entirely
                    agrees with his views and, in particular, with his comment on Russian bargaining
                    procedure and how to meet it.</p>
                <p>Yours sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Halifax</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d196-a1.xml" xpointer="d196-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d196-f1" n="15" xml:id="d196-f1-content">
                <p>Field Marshal Jan Christian Smuts, Prime Minister of the Union of South
                    Africa.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
